To deploy nginx into the system

1. Check if any other service is running right now
	>> sudo docker service ls
2. Deploy one service to my cluster
	>> sudo docker service create --replicas 3 -p 80:80 --name web1 nginx
	// replicas is the  number instance of the particular container
	// -p for port binding 
	// web1 is the new service name created
	// from the pre defined container nginx
3. To check if the containers are running
	>> sudo docker ps
4. To see all the details of the service web1
	>> sudo docker service inspect web1
5. To check all the nodes in the service
	>> sudo docker service ps web1
6. To check the application 
	>> curl http://172.31.44.254:80

